Id: no-channel-type-outside-surface
Pattern: \b(IChannel|ChannelItemInfo|ChannelItemResult|ChannelItemType|ChannelFolderType|ChannelMediaContentType|InternalChannelFeatures|ChannelParentalRating)\b
Subject: *.cs
Except: :!*SurfaceAdapter.cs
Issue: 52

A discover page is a server channel, and the server's channel types are the
shape that decision produced rather than the shape this plugin thinks in. If
one of them reaches the shelf code, the catalogue code or the seam, then
changing how the surface is represented means changing everything that touched
it, and the adapter that exists to absorb that change absorbs nothing.

The exception is the surface adapter itself, which is the one place the server's
channel vocabulary is allowed to be spoken.
